---
// HowItWorks.astro
---
<section class="os-section os-reveal" style="padding: 24px 0 48px; background: #ffffff; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light);">
  <div class="os-container">
    
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 24px;">
      <div class="os-eyebrow" style="margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--ink-secondary); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.85rem;">
        HOW AN AI EMPLOYEE WORKS
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hiw-flow">
      {/* Step 1 */}
      <div class="hiw-step">
        <div class="hiw-icon" style="background: var(--candy-pink-soft); color: var(--candy-pink);">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="hiw-content">
          <h4 style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--ink-black); margin-bottom: 4px;">1. Understand</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--ink-secondary); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">Understands your goal and requirements</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hiw-arrow">→</div>

      {/* Step 2 */}
      <div class="hiw-step">
        <div class="hiw-icon" style="background: var(--candy-pink-soft); color: var(--candy-pink);">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-3 7h3m-3 4h3m-6-4h.01M9 16h.01"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="hiw-content">
          <h4 style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--ink-black); margin-bottom: 4px;">2. Plan</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--ink-secondary); line-height: 1.4; margin: 0;">Creates a plan and chooses the best tools</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hiw-arrow">→</div>

      {/* Step 3 */}
      <div class="hiw-step">
        <div class="hiw-icon" style="background: var(--candy-pink-soft); color: var(--candy-pink);">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="hiw-content">
          <h4 style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--ink-black); margin-bottom: 4px;">3. Execute</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--ink-secondary); line-height: 1.4; margin: 0;">Takes action using trusted tools</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hiw-arrow">→</div>

      {/* Step 4 */}
      <div class="hiw-step">
        <div class="hiw-icon" style="background: var(--candy-pink); color: #ffffff;">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="hiw-content">
          <h4 style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--ink-black); margin-bottom: 4px;">4. Deliver</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--ink-secondary); line-height: 1.4; margin: 0;">Delivers results with full transparency</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hiw-arrow">→</div>

      {/* Step 5 */}
      <div class="hiw-step">
        <div class="hiw-icon" style="background: var(--candy-pink-soft); color: var(--candy-pink);">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="hiw-content">
          <h4 style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--ink-black); margin-bottom: 4px;">5. Improve</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--ink-secondary); line-height: 1.4; margin: 0;">Learns and improves over time</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hiw-flow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
  }
  
  .hiw-step {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0 10px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .hiw-icon {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }
  
  .hiw-step:hover .hiw-icon {
    transform: translateY(-4px) scale(1.05);
  }

  .hiw-arrow {
    color: var(--border-medium);
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 300;
    margin-top: 14px; /* Align with 48px icons */
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hiw-flow {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 32px;
    }
    .hiw-arrow {
      transform: rotate(90deg);
      margin-top: -10px;
      margin-bottom: -10px;
    }
    .hiw-step {
      max-width: 300px;
    }
  }
</style>
